#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:217
#| msgid "境外學生"
msgid "境外學生招生資訊"
msgstr "Overseas student admissions information"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:220
msgid "本頁彙整境外學生（僑生、外籍生、交換生）來臺就讀相關招生資訊，包含各學制申請資格、招生管道、獎學金及申請時程，助您順利規劃來臺求學之路。"
msgstr ""
"This page compiles relevant admissions information for overseas students "
"(overseas students, foreign students, and exchange students) to study in "
"Taiwan, including application qualifications for each academic system, "
"admissions channels, scholarships, and application timelines to help you "
"smoothly plan your path to study in Taiwan."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:223
msgid "多學制招生"
msgstr "Multi-study enrollment"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:224
msgid "多國籍適用"
msgstr "Applicable to multiple nationalities"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:225
msgid "獎學金機會"
msgstr "Scholarship Opportunities"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:226
msgid "分期申請時程"
msgstr "Installment application timetable"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:234
msgid "重要提醒："
msgstr "Important reminder:"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:235
msgid "各學制招生截止日期每年均可能調整，本頁資訊僅供參考，請務必以各校最新公告或海外聯招會官網為準。"
msgstr ""
"The admission deadline for each academic system may be adjusted every year. "
"The information on this page is for reference only. Please be sure to refer "
"to the latest announcements of each school or the official website of the "
"Overseas Joint Admissions Association."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:240
msgid "學制快速一覽"
msgstr "A quick overview of the academic system"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:244
msgid "學制種類"
msgstr "Type of academic system"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:245
msgid "類"
msgstr "kind"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:246
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:561
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:611
msgid "僑先部 / 學士班 / 研究所"
msgstr "Department of Overseas Chinese/Bachelor's Program/Research Institute"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:250
msgid "適用身份"
msgstr "Applicable status"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:251
msgid "種"
msgstr "kind"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:252
msgid "僑生 / 外籍生 / 交換生"
msgstr "Overseas Chinese students / foreign students / exchange students"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:256
msgid "可申請獎學金"
msgstr "Scholarships available"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:257
#| msgid "項"
msgid "多項"
msgstr "Multiple"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:258
msgid "教育部、學校、地方政府"
msgstr "Ministry of Education, schools, local governments"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:262
msgid "申請截止"
msgstr "Application deadline"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:263
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:569
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:619
msgid "約每年 3 月"
msgstr "Approximately March every year"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:264
msgid "各管道略有差異"
msgstr "Each pipeline is slightly different"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:269
msgid "招生學制說明"
msgstr "Admissions and Academic System Description"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:271
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:283
msgid "僑先部（預科）"
msgstr "Department of Overseas Chinese (preparatory course)"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:272
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:337
msgid "學士班"
msgstr "Bachelor's degree"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:274
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:445 .\users\models.py:96
#: .\users\templates\users\edit_profile.html:89
#: .\users\templates\users\profile_setup.html:125
msgid "外籍生"
msgstr "International Degree Student"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:275
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:499
msgid "交換生"
msgstr "Exchange Student"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:283
msgid "：針對僑生設立的一年制預備課程，修畢成績合格後可直升大學學士班，無需再參加大學入學考試。適合剛完成高中學業的僑生。"
msgstr ""
": A one-year preparatory course for overseas Chinese students. After passing"
" the course, they can directly enter the bachelor's degree program without "
"having to take the university entrance exam. Suitable for overseas students "
"who have just completed high school studies."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:290
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:452
msgid "申請資格"
msgstr "Eligibility"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:291
msgid "具僑生身份、完成相當於我國高中一至三年級學業（高中畢業），成績達一定標準。年齡通常不超過 25 歲。"
msgstr ""
"Applicants must have overseas Chinese status, have completed studies "
"equivalent to the first to third grade of high school in my country (high "
"school graduation), and have achieved certain academic standards. Usually no"
" more than 25 years old."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:293
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:348
msgid "高中畢業"
msgstr "high school graduation"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:294
msgid "僑生身份"
msgstr "Overseas Chinese identity"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:295
msgid "25 歲以下"
msgstr "Under 25"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:301
msgid "申請管道"
msgstr "Application pipeline"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:302
msgid "透過海外聯合招生委員會（海聯會）統一分發。馬來西亞、緬甸、印尼、港澳及其他地區各有獨立招生窗口。"
msgstr ""
"Distributed uniformly through the Overseas Joint Admissions Committee "
"(Overseas Joint Admissions Committee). Malaysia, Myanmar, Indonesia, Hong "
"Kong, Macao and other regions each have independent enrollment windows."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:304
msgid "海聯會"
msgstr "ALATS"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:305
msgid "統一分發"
msgstr "Unified distribution"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:311
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:365
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:420
msgid "申請時程"
msgstr "Application timetable"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:312
msgid "通常每年 1～3 月開放網路報名，各地區截止日期略有不同。錄取結果約 5～6 月公告，8 月底至 9 月初入學報到。"
msgstr ""
"Online registration is usually open from January to March every year, and "
"the deadlines vary slightly in each region. Admission results will be "
"announced around May to June, and registration will be from the end of "
"August to the beginning of September."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:314
msgid "1～3 月報名"
msgstr "Registration from January to March"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:315
msgid "5～6 月放榜"
msgstr "Ranking released from May to June"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:316
msgid "9 月入學"
msgstr "Admission in September"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:322
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:375
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:430
msgid "獎助學金"
msgstr "Scholarships and Bursaries"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:323
msgid "教育部提供僑生獎學金，另有各校及地方政府補助。成績優良僑生可申請教育部華語獎學金或特定區域補助。"
msgstr ""
"The Ministry of Education provides scholarships for overseas Chinese "
"students, as well as subsidies from various schools and local governments. "
"Overseas students with excellent academic performance can apply for the "
"Ministry of Education Chinese Scholarship or specific regional subsidies."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:325
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:378
msgid "教育部獎學金"
msgstr "Ministry of Education Scholarship"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:326
msgid "學校補助"
msgstr "school subsidies"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:337
msgid "：四年制大學課程（部分系所五年），僑生透過海聯會申請，外籍生另有各校獨立招生管道。修業成績合格者授予學士學位。"
msgstr ""
": For four-year university courses (five years in some departments), "
"overseas students apply through the Overseas Chinese Federation, and foreign"
" students have independent admissions channels for each school. Those who "
"pass the academic examination will be awarded a bachelor's degree."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:344
msgid "僑生申請資格"
msgstr "Application Qualifications for Overseas Chinese Students"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:345
msgid "具僑生身份、完成高中（高級中等學校）學業成績合格，或持有同等學力證明。馬來西亞 SPM 成績、緬甸高中畢業等均可申請。"
msgstr ""
"Applicants must have overseas Chinese status and have completed high school "
"(senior secondary school) with satisfactory academic performance, or hold a "
"certificate of equivalent academic ability. Malaysian SPM results, Myanmar "
"high school graduation, etc. can apply."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:347
msgid "海聯會管道"
msgstr "Overseas Alliance Pipeline"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:349
msgid "同等學力"
msgstr "Equivalent academic level"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:355
msgid "外籍生申請資格"
msgstr "Eligibility for foreign students to apply"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:356
msgid "持外國國籍、高中（或同等）學業成績達各校最低標準。部分校系要求中文或英文能力證明（HSK、TOCFL、TOEFL、IELTS 等）。"
msgstr ""
"Hold foreign nationality and have high school (or equivalent) academic "
"performance that meets the minimum standards of each school. Some schools "
"and departments require proof of Chinese or English proficiency (HSK, TOCFL,"
" TOEFL, IELTS, etc.)."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:358
msgid "各校獨立招生"
msgstr "Each school recruits students independently"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:359
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:403
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:456
msgid "語言能力"
msgstr "language ability"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:366
msgid "海聯會管道通常 1～3 月報名；各校獨立招生另有時程（多在 3～5 月）。建議提早確認目標校系公告。"
msgstr ""
"Registration for the AIS pipeline usually takes place from January to March;"
" independent admissions for each school have other schedules (mostly from "
"March to May). It is recommended to check the target school and department "
"announcement in advance."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:368
msgid "1～3 月（海聯會）"
msgstr "January to March (Overseas Alliance)"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:369
msgid "3～5 月（各校）"
msgstr "March to May (each school)"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:376
msgid "教育部僑生獎學金（每月約 NT$5,000～8,000）；各校可能另有入學獎學金或成績獎助。外籍生可申請教育部臺灣獎學金。"
msgstr ""
"The Ministry of Education’s Overseas Chinese Scholarship (approximately "
"NT$5,000~8,000 per month); each school may also have entrance scholarships "
"or performance awards. Foreign students can apply for the Ministry of "
"Education Taiwan Scholarship."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:379
#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:433
msgid "臺灣獎學金"
msgstr "Taiwan Scholarship"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:380
msgid "學校獎助"
msgstr "School scholarships"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:391
msgid "：包含碩士班（2 年）與博士班（3～5 年），透過各校研究所獨立招生，部分學校設有英文授課專班。"
msgstr ""
": Including master's programs (2 years) and doctoral programs (3 to 5 "
"years), which are independently recruited through the research institutes of"
" each school. Some schools have special classes taught in English."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:398
msgid "碩士班申請資格"
msgstr "Master's degree application qualifications"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:399
msgid "大學（學士）學位畢業，成績達各校系所最低標準。部分系所要求相關領域背景或語言能力證明（中文 / 英文）。"
msgstr ""
"Graduation from a university (bachelor's) degree, with grades that meet the "
"minimum standards of each school or department. Some departments require "
"relevant field background or proof of language proficiency "
"(Chinese/English)."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:401
msgid "學士畢業"
msgstr "Bachelor's degreeGraduation"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:402
msgid "相關領域"
msgstr "Related fields"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:409
msgid "博士班申請資格"
msgstr "Eligibility to apply for doctoral program"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:410
msgid "碩士學位畢業（或同等學力），具研究潛力。通常需提交研究計畫書及相關推薦信。部分系所接受優秀碩士生直攻博士。"
msgstr ""
"Master's degree (or equivalent) with research potential. Usually, a research"
" proposal and relevant letters of recommendation are required. Some "
"departments accept outstanding master's students to study directly for Ph.D."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:412
msgid "碩士畢業"
msgstr "Master's degree"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:413
msgid "研究計畫"
msgstr "research project"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:414
msgid "推薦信"
msgstr "Letter of recommendation"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:421
msgid "各校研究所招生時程不一，多在 10 月～3 月期間。建議直接查閱目標系所官網確認截止日期及備審資料需求。"
msgstr ""
"The enrollment period for each school's graduate school varies, mostly from "
"October to March. It is recommended to directly check the official website "
"of the target department to confirm the deadline and the requirements for "
"review materials."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:423
msgid "依各所公告"
msgstr "According to the announcement of each agency"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:424
msgid "10 月～3 月"
msgstr "October to March"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:431
msgid "教育部臺灣獎學金（外籍研究生）；教育部僑生獎學金（僑生）；各校研究助理（RA）薪資，及科技部研究計畫補助。"
msgstr ""
"Taiwan Scholarship from the Ministry of Education (foreign graduate "
"students); Overseas Chinese Scholarship from the Ministry of Education "
"(overseas students); salaries of research assistants (RA) in each school, "
"and research project subsidies from the Ministry of Science and Technology."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:434
msgid "研究助理薪資"
msgstr "Research Assistant Salary"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:445
msgid "：持外國國籍、非以僑生身份申請的學生。透過各大學獨立招生辦理，入學後須辦理外僑居留證（ARC）。"
msgstr ""
": Students with foreign nationality who are not applying as overseas "
"students. Through independent admissions procedures at each university, you "
"must apply for an Alien Residence Certificate (ARC) after admission."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:455
msgid "外國國籍"
msgstr "foreign nationality"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:457
msgid "前置學歷"
msgstr "Prerequisite academic qualifications"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:463
msgid "所需備審文件"
msgstr "Required documents for review"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:464
msgid "護照、最高學歷成績單及畢業證書（含中英文公證）、語言能力證明、個人陳述（讀書計畫）、推薦信（研究所）、體檢報告。"
msgstr ""
"Passport, highest academic transcript and graduation certificate (including "
"notarization in Chinese and English), language proficiency certificate, "
"personal statement (study plan), recommendation letter (research institute),"
" and physical examination report."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:466
msgid "學歷公證"
msgstr "Notarization of academic qualifications"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:467
msgid "讀書計畫"
msgstr "reading plan"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:473
msgid "教育部臺灣獎學金"
msgstr "Ministry of Education Taiwan Scholarship"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:474
msgid "每月生活費 NT$15,000～25,000（依學制），免學雜費，可申請 1～4 年，名額有限，需透過台灣駐外機構或各大學推薦申請。"
msgstr ""
"Monthly living expenses range from NT$15,000 to NT$25,000 (depending on the "
"academic system). Tuition and miscellaneous fees are waived. Applications "
"can be made for 1 to 4 years. Places are limited. Applications must be "
"recommended by Taiwanese overseas agencies or universities."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:476
msgid "NT$15,000~/月"
msgstr "NT$15,000~/month"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:477
msgid "免學雜費"
msgstr "Free tuition and fees"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:478
msgid "名額有限"
msgstr "Limited places"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:484
msgid "入台後必辦事項"
msgstr "Things to do after arriving in Taiwan"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:485
msgid "持學生居留簽入台後，須在 15 天內辦理外僑居留證（ARC），之後再辦理健保加保、開立銀行帳戶等。"
msgstr ""
"After checking in with a student residence permit, you must apply for an "
"Alien Residence Certificate (ARC) within 15 days, and then apply for health "
"insurance coverage, open a bank account, etc."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:487
msgid "15 天內辦 ARC"
msgstr "Apply for ARC within 15 days"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:488
msgid "健保加保"
msgstr "Health insurance supplement"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:499
msgid "：由原就讀學校與台灣大學締結交換協議，短期（半年或一學年）交換就讀。學分可依協議返校抵免，通常免繳台灣學雜費。"
msgstr ""
": The original school concludes an exchange agreement with a Taiwanese "
"university to study for a short term (half a year or one academic year). "
"Credits can be used as credits when returning to school according to the "
"agreement, and Taiwan tuition and fees are usually exempted."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:507
msgid "透過原就讀學校的交流合作辦公室提名，再由台灣大學審核。無法直接向台灣大學申請，須先確認原校有締結交換協議。"
msgstr ""
"Nominated through the Exchange and Cooperation Office of the original "
"school, and then reviewed by National Taiwan University. If you cannot apply"
" directly to National Taiwan University, you must first confirm that the "
"original school has concluded an exchange agreement."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:509
msgid "原校提名"
msgstr "Nominated by original school"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:510
msgid "需締結協議"
msgstr "Agreement required"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:516
msgid "期程與截止"
msgstr "Schedule and deadlines"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:517
msgid "上學期（9 月）入學者通常 3～4 月截止提名；下學期（2 月）入學者通常 10～11 月截止。依各校締約條件而有不同。"
msgstr ""
"The nomination deadline for applicants who enrolled in the previous semester"
" (September) is usually March to April; the deadline for nomination for "
"applicants who enrolled in the next semester (February) is usually October "
"to November. The contract conditions vary by school."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:519
msgid "上學期：3～4 月"
msgstr "Last semester: March to April"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:520
msgid "下學期：10～11 月"
msgstr "Next semester: October to November"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:526
msgid "簽證與居留"
msgstr "Visa and residence"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:527
msgid "短期（6 個月以內）可持觀光簽入台，無需辦理 ARC；6 個月以上則須以學生居留簽入台，並辦理外僑居留證。"
msgstr ""
"For short-term stays (within 6 months), you can enter Taiwan with a tourist "
"visa and do not need to apply for an ARC; if you stay for more than 6 "
"months, you must enter Taiwan with a student residence permit and apply for "
"an alien residence permit."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:529
msgid "≤6 月：觀光簽"
msgstr "≤6 months: tourist visa"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:530
msgid ">6 月：需 ARC"
msgstr ">6 months: ARC required"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:536
msgid "費用說明"
msgstr "Fee description"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:537
msgid "依多數交換協議，台灣大學免收交換生學雜費。生活費（宿舍、餐飲、交通等）需自行負擔，每月約 NT$10,000～15,000。"
msgstr ""
"Under most exchange agreements, National Taiwan University waives tuition "
"and fees for exchange students. Living expenses (dormitory, meals, "
"transportation, etc.) need to be paid by yourself, which is about "
"NT$10,000~15,000 per month."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:539
msgid "學雜費全免"
msgstr "Tuition and fees are free"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:540
msgid "生活費自理"
msgstr "Pay for your own living expenses"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:547
msgid "各地區僑生申請資訊"
msgstr ""
"Application information for overseas Chinese students in various regions"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:550
msgid "以下為海外聯合招生委員會（海聯會）各地區招生辦公室資訊。各地區因學制不同，申請資格與截止日期可能有所差異，請以海聯會最新公告為準。"
msgstr ""
"The following is information about the regional admissions offices of the "
"Overseas Joint Admissions Committee (Overseas Joint Admissions Committee). "
"Due to different academic systems in various regions, application "
"qualifications and deadlines may be different. Please refer to the latest "
"announcement from the Overseas Alliance."

