msgstr "About NT$28,000 ~ 35,000"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:725
msgid "僑生與本地生同標準"
msgstr "Overseas students and local students have the same standards"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:729
msgid "學士班學雜費（理工醫）"
msgstr ""
"Tuition and Miscellaneous Fees for Bachelor's Degree (Science, Engineering, "
"Medicine)"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:732
msgid "約 NT$35,000 ～ 45,000"
msgstr "About NT$35,000 ~ 45,000"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:733
msgid "部分系所有額外實習費"
msgstr "Some departments have additional internship fees"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:737
msgid "研究所學雜費（碩士）"
msgstr "Graduate Tuition and Fees (Master's)"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:740
msgid "約 NT$30,000 ～ 48,000"
msgstr "About NT$30,000 ~ 48,000"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:741
msgid "英語授課專班費用較高"
msgstr "English-taught special classes are more expensive"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:745
msgid "宿舍費（學校宿舍）"
msgstr "Dormitory fee (school dormitory)"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:748
msgid "約 NT$8,000 ～ 18,000"
msgstr "About NT$8,000 ~ 18,000"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:749
msgid "依房型，境外生享優先保障"
msgstr ""
"Depending on the room type, overseas students enjoy priority protection"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:753
msgid "生活費（餐飲 / 交通 / 日用）"
msgstr "Living expenses (meals/transportation/daily necessities)"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:754
msgid "每月"
msgstr "per month"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:756
msgid "約 NT$8,000 ～ 15,000"
msgstr "About NT$8,000 ~ 15,000"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:757
msgid "視個人消費習慣而異"
msgstr "Varies depending on personal spending habits"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:761
msgid "全民健康保險費"
msgstr "National health insurance premium"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:762
msgid "每月（持 ARC 加保後）"
msgstr "Monthly (after adding insurance with ARC)"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:764
msgid "約 NT$749"
msgstr "About NT$749"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:765
msgid "在台超過 4 個月須加保"
msgstr ""
"If you stay in Taiwan for more than 4 months, you must purchase insurance"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:771
msgid "申請時程建議（學士班僑生為例）"
msgstr ""
"Suggested application schedule (for overseas Chinese students in bachelor’s "
"degree program as an example)"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:776
msgid "了解申請資訊與準備文件"
msgstr "Understand application information and prepare documents"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:777
msgid "前往海聯會官網確認當年度招生簡章，了解各學制申請資格、需備文件及時程。同時確認學歷文件（成績單、畢業證書）是否需要公認證。"
msgstr ""
"Go to the official website of the Overseas Alliance to confirm the current "
"year's admissions brochure and learn about the application qualifications, "
"required documents and schedule for each academic system. Also confirm "
"whether academic documents (transcripts, graduation certificates) require "
"notarization."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:778
msgid "每年 10 月～12 月"
msgstr "Every year from October to December"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:779
msgid "準備學歷文件"
msgstr "Prepare academic documents"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:785
msgid "向當地承辦窗口取得申請表"
msgstr "Obtain the application form from the local hosting window"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:786
msgid "聯繫所在地區的海聯會承辦窗口（如馬來西亞留台同學會、緬甸華校教師會等），取得當年度申請表及相關說明，確認繳件方式（線上 / 郵寄）。"
msgstr ""
"Contact the organizer of the Overseas Alliance in your region (such as the "
"Malaysian Alumni Association in Taiwan, Myanmar Chinese School Teachers "
"Association, etc.) to obtain the current year's application form and "
"relevant instructions, and confirm the payment method (online/mail)."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:787
msgid "每年 1 月"
msgstr "every January"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:788
msgid "提早聯繫避免遺漏"
msgstr "Contact early to avoid missing out"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:794
msgid "線上報名並繳交備審資料"
msgstr "Register online and submit application materials"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:795
msgid "至海聯會網路報名系統填寫志願序（可填多個志願），並上傳或郵寄所需文件（成績單、護照、照片等）。確認申請費繳納方式。"
msgstr ""
"Fill in the application form (you can fill in multiple applications) in the "
"Overseas Alliance online registration system, and upload or mail the "
"required documents (transcripts, passports, photos, etc.). Confirm how to "
"pay the application fee."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:796
msgid "每年 1 月～3 月"
msgstr "January to March every year"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:797
msgid "備審文件繳交"
msgstr "Submission of documents for review"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:803
msgid "等待審查結果與放榜"
msgstr "Waiting for review results and release of rankings"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:804
msgid "申請截止後由海聯會及各校審查。通常於每年 5～6 月公告錄取結果。請密切注意海聯會官網及承辦窗口通知。"
msgstr ""
"Applications will be reviewed by the AIS and each school after the deadline."
" Admission results are usually announced from May to June every year. Please"
" pay close attention to the official website of the Overseas Alliance and "
"the notification from the hosting window."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:805
msgid "每年 5 月～6 月"
msgstr "May to June every year"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:811
msgid "確認志願並辦理赴台簽證"
msgstr "Confirm your intention and apply for a visa to Taiwan"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:812
msgid "收到錄取通知後，依指定期限確認接受錄取。向台灣駐外機構（如台北經濟文化辦事處）申請學生居留簽證（Resident Visa）。"
msgstr ""
"After receiving the admission notice, confirm acceptance according to the "
"specified deadline. Apply for a student residence visa (Resident Visa) from "
"Taiwan’s overseas missions (such as the Taipei Economic and Cultural "
"Office)."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:813
msgid "每年 6 月～7 月"
msgstr "June to July every year"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:814
msgid "辦理學生居留簽"
msgstr "Apply for student residence visa"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:820
msgid "抵台入學報到"
msgstr "Arrive in Taiwan and register for admission"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:821
msgid "抵台後按學校通知時程辦理入學報到，並在 15 天內至移民署辦理外僑居留證（ARC）。同時參加學校國際事務處的新生說明會。"
msgstr ""
"After arriving in Taiwan, you must register for admission according to the "
"schedule notified by the school, and go to the Immigration Department to "
"apply for an Alien Residence Certificate (ARC) within 15 days. At the same "
"time, attend the orientation meeting for new students held by the "
"International Affairs Office of the school."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:822
msgid "每年 8 月底～9 月初"
msgstr "Every year from the end of August to the beginning of September"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:823
msgid "完成入學！"
msgstr "Enrollment completed!"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:833
msgid "我是外籍生（非僑生），可以透過海聯會申請嗎？"
msgstr ""
"I am a foreign student (non-overseas Chinese), can I apply through the "
"Overseas Alliance?"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:844
msgid "僑生與外籍生有什麼不同？"
msgstr ""
"What is the difference between overseas Chinese students and foreign "
"students?"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:855
msgid "可以同時申請多所學校嗎？"
msgstr "Can I apply to multiple schools at the same time?"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:866
msgid "中文不夠好，可以申請中文授課的系所嗎？"
msgstr ""
"If my Chinese is not good enough, can I apply for a department that teaches "
"in Chinese?"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:877
msgid "申請獎學金需要另外申請嗎？"
msgstr "Do I need to apply separately to apply for a scholarship?"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:888
msgid "我已在台灣就讀，可以轉學嗎？"
msgstr "I am already studying in Taiwan, can I transfer?"

