msgstr ""
"After confirming your admission, apply for a student residence visa "
"(Resident Visa) to the Taiwanese overseas office where you are located."

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:944
msgid "外來人士在台生活諮詢專線"
msgstr "Consultation hotline for foreigners living in Taiwan"

#: .\flows\templates\flows\admissions_guide.html:946
msgid "提供多語言（英、日、韓、越、泰、印尼等）諮詢服務，解答在台生活及就學問題。"
msgstr ""
"Provide multi-language (English, Japanese, Korean, Vietnamese, Thai, "
