msgid "申請須知 / 注意事項"
msgstr "Application Notes / Important Notices"

msgid "以下為內政部移民署官方申請須知（節錄自官方網站）"
msgstr ""
"The following are official NIA application notes (excerpted from the "
"official website)"

msgid ""
"在大陸、海外地區或港澳製作之文書，應經海基會、駐外館處或臺北經濟文化辦事處（香港、澳門）驗證。依規定繳附之文件為外文者，應經駐外館處驗證，並檢附經駐外館驗證或國內公證人認證之中譯本；預防接種證明為外文者，應至該管衛生所轉譯登錄。但依外國人才專法第二十四條準用同法第九條規定申請就業金卡者，免附。"
msgstr ""
"Documents produced in mainland China, overseas, Hong Kong, or Macau must "
"be authenticated by the SEF, an overseas mission, or TECRO (Hong "
"Kong/Macau). Foreign-language documents must be authenticated by an "
"overseas mission with a Chinese translation certified by the mission or "
"a notary in Taiwan. Foreign-language vaccination records must be "
"transcribed at the local health center. (Exception: Gold Card applicants "
"under the Act for the Recruitment and Employment of Foreign "
"Professionals.)"

msgid ""
"居留一定期間之計算方式：自定居申請日往前推算，在臺連續居留滿一年（一年內得出境三十日，出境次數不予限制）或連續居留滿二年且每年在臺居住二百七十日以上。"
msgstr ""
"Calculating the required period of residence: counting back from the "
"date of permanent residency application, continuous residence in Taiwan "
"for one full year (departures of up to 30 days per year permitted, no "
"limit on number of trips) or continuous residence for two years with at "
"least 270 days per year."

msgid ""
"經許可居留，在臺灣地區居留一定期間，仍具備原居留條件者（親屬關係因結婚或收養發生者，應存續三年以上。但婚姻關係存續期間已生產子女者，不在此限），得申請在臺灣地區定居。"
msgstr ""
"Those permitted to reside who have lived in Taiwan for the required "
"period and still meet the original conditions (family relationships "
"arising from marriage or adoption must have existed for at least 3 "
"years; exception if children were born during the marriage) may apply "
"for permanent residency."

msgid ""
"經中央目的事業主管機關核准來臺就學者畢業後（HF168），依第十六條第一項第八款規定經許可居留連續滿五年，每年在臺灣地區居住一百八十三日以上，且最近一年於臺灣地區平均每月收入達中央勞動主管機關公告基本工資二倍以上者，得申請在臺灣地區定居。"
msgstr ""
"Graduates approved to study in Taiwan by the central competent authority "
"(HF168) who have resided continuously for 5 years under Article "
"16(1)(8), resided in Taiwan for at least 183 days per year, and whose "
"average monthly income in the most recent year is at least twice the "
"minimum wage announced by the central labor authority, may apply for "
"permanent residency."

msgid ""
"臺灣地區居留證有效期間屆滿前三十日內，原申請居留原因仍繼續存在者，得申請延期，每次不得逾二年；學生申請畢業延期居留者，自畢業當日起算六個月，延期居留期間屆滿前，得再申請延期一次，總延期居留期間最長為一年。（應備文件：1.申請書、2.臺灣地區居留證、3.其他相關證明文件）"
msgstr ""
"Within 30 days before ARC expiry, if the original reason for residence "
"still applies, an extension may be applied for; each extension cannot "
"exceed 2 years. Students applying for post-graduation residence "
"extension have 6 months from graduation and may apply for one further "
"extension; total extension cannot exceed 1 year. (Required: 1. "
"Application form 2. Taiwan ARC 3. Other relevant documents)"

msgid ""
"依外國人才專法第二十四條規定經許可居留，原申請居留原因仍繼續存在者，得申請延期居留：1.準用同法第八條規定者：每次最長為五年。2.準用同法第五條至第七條、第九條及第十條規定者：每次最長為三年。"
msgstr ""
"For those permitted to reside under Article 24 of the Act for the "
"Recruitment and Employment of Foreign Professionals, if the original "
"reason still applies, extension may be applied: 1. Under Article 8 of "
"the same Act: up to 5 years per extension. 2. Under Articles 5–7, 9, and "
"10: up to 3 years per extension."

msgid "曾逾停留期限超過三十日未滿一年者，不予許可期間自其出境之日起算一年；逾期停留一年以上未滿二年者，起算二年；逾期停留二年以上者，起算三年。"
msgstr ""
"Those who overstayed by more than 30 days but less than 1 year are "
"barred for 1 year from departure; overstay of 1–2 years: barred 2 years; "
"overstay of 2 years or more: barred 3 years."

msgid "申請案件資料不符或欠缺者，應於書面通知送達之翌日起三個月內補正；未於規定期間補正或補正仍不合規定者，駁回其申請。"
msgstr ""
"Applicants with missing or incorrect documents must correct them within "
"3 months of receiving written notice; failure to correct within the "
"period or correction still not meeting requirements results in "
"rejection."

msgid "香港澳門居民以依親事由及其隨同申請之未成年子女申請在臺灣地區居留，其親屬關係因收養發生者，應存續二年以上。"
msgstr ""
"HK/Macau residents applying for residency based on family reunion, along "
"with minor children, must have had the family relationship through "
"adoption for at least 2 years."

msgid ""
"港澳居民逾期居留未滿三十日，原申請居留原因仍繼續存在者，經依相關規定處罰、繳清罰鍰後，得向本署重新申請居留；港澳居民未於居留期間屆滿前經許可延期居留，且逾期居留三十日以上者，應繳清罰款，並申請出境證出境。"
msgstr ""
"HK/Macau residents who overstay by less than 30 days and still meet the "
"original conditions may reapply after paying fines. Those who overstay "
"30 days or more without an approved extension must pay fines and apply "
"for a departure permit to exit."

msgid "港澳居民依外國人才專法第二十四條規定準用同法第九條規定以網路申請平臺申請就業金卡者，相關規定請參考「外國特定專業人才申請就業金卡送件須知」。"
msgstr ""
"HK/Macau residents applying for an Employment Gold Card via the online "
"platform under Article 24 of the Act for Foreign Professionals should "
"refer to the \"Submission Guidelines for Foreign Special Professionals "
"Applying for an Employment Gold Card\"."

