"Freshmen and transfer students must complete registration and tuition "
"payment in their first semester before applying for leave"

msgid "休學當學期已選課程一律取消，不計成績（預修與抵免課程除外）"
msgstr ""
"All courses registered in the semester of leave will be cancelled with no "
"grades recorded (except pre-approved and credit-exempted courses)"

msgid "休學期間不計入修業年限"
msgstr "Leave period does not count toward the academic time limit"

msgid "服兵役、懷孕、生產、照顧未滿 3 歲子女所致休學"
msgstr ""
"Leave due to military service, pregnancy, childbirth, or caring for a child "
"under 3 years old"

msgid "不計入累計年限"
msgstr "Not counted in cumulative limit"

msgid "外籍生 ARC 注意"
msgstr "International Students — ARC Notice"

msgid ""
"辦理休學後，學生身份的居留證即失效，需在規定期限內離台。恢復前須重新申請學生簽證。請在確定休學前先聯絡國際事務處（分機 57081）確認程序。"
msgstr ""
"After taking a leave of absence, your student ARC becomes invalid and you "
"must leave Taiwan within the required period. You must re-apply for a "
"student visa before returning. Please contact the Office of International "
"Affairs (ext. 57081) to confirm procedures before finalizing your leave."

msgid "宿舍：休學前須完成退宿手續。復學後需重新申請宿舍，不保留床位。"
msgstr ""
"Dormitory: You must complete dorm check-out procedures before taking leave. "
"After returning, you must re-apply for dormitory housing — your bed is not "
"reserved."

msgid "復學"
msgstr "Reinstatement"

msgid "自動復學"
msgstr "Auto-reinstatement"

msgid "休學期滿即自動復學"
msgstr "Automatically reinstated when leave period expires"

msgid "註冊期限"
msgstr "Registration deadline"

msgid "當學期註冊日（含）前"
msgstr "By registration day of the current semester (inclusive)"

msgid "提前復學"
msgstr "Early reinstatement"

msgid "最遲於註冊日前申請"
msgstr "Apply no later than the registration date"

msgid "休學期滿後自動回復學籍，須於當學期校曆註冊日（含）前完成報到與繳費"
msgstr ""
"Student status is automatically restored upon expiry of leave; you must "
"check in and pay tuition by the registration date on the academic calendar "
"(inclusive)"

msgid "提前復學：須於預定復學學期的註冊日前提出申請，不可在休學中途直接回來上課"
msgstr ""
"Early reinstatement: Apply before the registration date of the intended "
"return semester. You may not simply return to class mid-leave."

msgid "復學後回到原學系，年級銜接休學前的年級繼續就讀"
msgstr ""
"Upon reinstatement, you return to your original department at the same year "
"level as when you left"

msgid "若屆時無法如期復學，需於註冊日前再次申請延續休學；逾期未辦者視情形處理"
msgstr ""
"If you cannot return as scheduled, re-apply for a leave extension before the"
" registration date; failure to do so will be handled according to "
"regulations"

msgid "復學後的畢業條件，依入學當年度的學則與相關規章認定"
msgstr ""
"Graduation requirements after reinstatement follow the academic regulations "
"of the year of enrollment"

msgid "轉系"
msgstr "Department Transfer"

msgid "申請時間依當學年度校曆公告，每輪申請限報名一個科系，超過一個即取消資格。"
msgstr ""
"Application period is announced in the annual academic calendar. Each round "
"is limited to one department — applying to more than one will disqualify "
"you."

msgid "申請資格（年級）"
msgstr "Eligibility (by year)"

msgid "大二"
msgstr "2nd Year"

msgid "升大二前可申請"
msgstr "May apply before advancing to 2nd year"

msgid "大三"
msgstr "3rd Year"

msgid "升大三前可申請"
msgstr "May apply before advancing to 3rd year"

msgid "大四"
msgstr "4th Year"

msgid "四年級生不得申請"
msgstr "4th-year students may not apply"

msgid "休學中"
msgstr "On Leave"

msgid "休學期間不得申請"
msgstr "Cannot apply while on leave"

msgid "每一申請週期只能申請一個科系，多報即全部取消資格"
msgstr ""
"Only one department per application cycle — applying to multiple departments"
" disqualifies all applications"

msgid "各系可自訂審查標準（如成績排名），但排名門檻不得高於前 50%（即以班排名前半段為上限）"
msgstr ""
"Departments may set their own criteria (e.g. grade ranking), but the ranking"
" threshold cannot exceed the top 50% (i.e. top half of the class)"

msgid "轉入名額上限：各系每年級最多招收原核定名額的 20%"
msgstr ""
"Transfer quota limit: Each department may accept up to 20% of the originally"
" approved enrollment per year level"

msgid "升大四前申請者，可轉入性質相近系的同年級，或轉入性質不同系的二三年級"
msgstr ""
"Applicants entering 4th year may transfer to the same year in a similar "
"department, or to 2nd/3rd year in a different type of department"

msgid "核准後不可撤回，原系修過的學分可申請抵免，由新系系主任審核認定"
msgstr ""
"Approval cannot be revoked. Credits earned in the original department may be"
" applied for exemption, subject to approval by the new department chair"

msgid "離島優惠入學生、國防大學生等特定身份不得申請轉系"
msgstr ""
"Students admitted under offshore island preferences, national defense "
"university students, and other specific categories are not eligible to "
"transfer departments"

msgid "雙主修"
msgstr "Double Major"

msgid "申請時間依校曆公告。大二起至修業年限最後一年第一學期止（延修期間不得新申請）。"
msgstr ""
"Application period is announced in the academic calendar. From 2nd year up "
"to the first semester of the final year (new applications not allowed during"
" extended enrollment)."

msgid "最早申請"
msgstr "Earliest application"

msgid "大二開始"
msgstr "From 2nd year"

msgid "最晚申請"
msgstr "Latest application"

msgid "畢業年級第一學期"
msgstr "First semester of graduating year"

msgid "額外延修"
msgstr "Extra extended enrollment"

msgid "最多 1 學年"
msgstr "Up to 1 academic year"

msgid "需同時完成本系全部畢業要求，以及加修學系的所有「專業必修」科目學分"
msgstr ""
"You must simultaneously complete all graduation requirements of your home "
"department and all required major courses of the additional department"

msgid "各系可自訂申請條件（如 GPA 門檻），需向目標系查詢當年公告"
msgstr ""
"Departments may set their own application requirements (e.g. GPA threshold);"
" check the current year's announcement from the target department"

msgid "學位證書上並列兩個學系名稱；畢業成績單亦加註雙主修"
msgstr ""
"The diploma lists both department names; the official transcript also notes "
"the double major"

msgid "若加修學分未能完成 → 可申請再延修一學年，或放棄雙主修僅以本系學分畢業"
msgstr ""
"If additional major credits cannot be completed → may apply for one more "
"year of extended enrollment, or abandon the double major and graduate with "
"home department credits only"

msgid "若已修完的加修學分符合輔系規定 → 可改認定為輔系資格"
msgstr ""
"If completed additional major credits meet the minor requirements → may be "
"recognized as a minor instead"

msgid "備用選項"
msgstr "Backup option"

msgid "延修期間（因雙主修而延修）：9 學分以下按學分費計；10 學分以上收全額學雜費"
msgstr ""
"Extended enrollment (due to double major): ≤9 credits charged per-credit; "
"≥10 credits charged full tuition and fees"

msgid "確認加修學系的申請條件"
msgstr "Confirm the application requirements of the additional department"

msgid "各系 GPA 門檻與名額不同，至目標系系辦查詢當年公告"
msgstr ""
"GPA thresholds and quotas vary by department; check this year's announcement"
" at the target department office"

msgid "填寫申請表，經本系主任同意"
msgstr ""
"Complete the application form and obtain your home department chair's "
"approval"

msgid "表格至教務處或各系系辦索取"
msgstr ""
"Forms are available at the Academic Affairs Office or each department office"

msgid "送交加修學系審核"
msgstr "Submit to the additional department for review"

msgid "目標系系主任同意後，轉呈教務長核准"
msgstr ""
"After the target department chair approves, forward to the Dean of Academic "
"Affairs for final approval"

msgid "核准後按加修課表修課"
msgstr "After approval, follow the additional department's course schedule"

msgid "可選擇每學期邊修或在畢業學期一次申請資格審核（自主規劃路線）"
msgstr ""
"You may choose to take courses each semester or apply for qualification "
"review all at once in the graduation semester (self-directed path)"

msgid "辦理窗口"
msgstr "Contact Offices"

msgid "教務處 / 註冊組"
msgstr "Academic Affairs Office / Registration Section"

msgid "學籍異動（休學、復學、轉系）"
msgstr "Student status changes (leave, reinstatement, department transfer)"

msgid "外籍生休學 ARC 問題"
msgstr "ARC issues related to leave of absence for international students"

msgid "各系系辦"
msgstr "Each department office"

msgid "轉系、雙主修申請條件查詢"
msgstr "Inquiries about transfer and double major application requirements"

msgid "及課程規劃建議"
msgstr "And course planning advice"

msgid "在學證明・成績單・推薦信"
msgstr "Certificate of Enrollment · Transcript · Recommendation Letter"

msgid "在學證明"
msgstr "Certificate of Enrollment"

msgid "線上自印"
msgstr "Self-print online"

msgid "Portal 自行列印"
msgstr "Print via Portal"

msgid "登入 Portal → 學生服務 → 在學證明列印。無公章，適用一般用途。"
msgstr ""
"Log in to Portal → Student Services → Print Certificate of Enrollment. No "
"official seal — suitable for general use."

msgid "臨櫃申請"
msgstr "In-person application"

msgid "教務處 / 註冊組（含公章）"
msgstr "Academic Affairs Office / Registration Section (with official seal)"

msgid "需蓋學校公章者至教務處（行政大樓）辦理，通常當場或隔日取件。"
msgstr ""
"If an official school seal is required, apply at the Academic Affairs Office"
" (Administration Building). Usually available immediately or the next day."

msgid "有效期限通常為 3 個月，申請前確認用途所需格式（中文或英文）。"
msgstr ""
"Validity is usually 3 months. Confirm the required format (Chinese or "
"English) before applying."

msgid "成績單"
msgstr "Academic Transcript"

msgid "Portal 自行列印（非正式）"
msgstr "Print via Portal (unofficial)"

msgid "Portal → 學生服務 → 成績查詢 → 列印。不含公章，供個人參考或非正式用途。"
msgstr ""
"Portal → Student Services → Grade Inquiry → Print. No official seal — for "
"personal reference or unofficial use."

msgid "教務處 / 註冊組（含公章 / 英文版）"
msgstr ""
"Academic Affairs Office / Registration Section (with official seal / English"
" version)"

msgid "正式成績單（含公章）或英文成績單，至教務處申請，通常需支付工本費。"
msgstr ""
"Official transcript (with official seal) or English transcript — apply at "
"the Academic Affairs Office; a processing fee is usually required."

msgid "申請前確認對方是否要求「校長章」或「英文版」，不同用途規格不同。"
msgstr ""
"Before applying, confirm whether the receiving party requires a president's "
"seal or an English version — requirements vary by purpose."

msgid "推薦信由教授撰寫，學校不直接提供，需自行向教授申請。"
msgstr ""
"Recommendation letters are written by professors — the school does not "
"provide them directly. You must request one from the professor yourself."

msgid "確定需求，提早 2–4 週聯絡教授"
msgstr "Confirm your needs and contact the professor 2–4 weeks in advance"

msgid "說明用途（申請學校 / 獎學金）、繳交截止日、語言（中文或英文）。"
msgstr ""
"Explain the purpose (university application / scholarship), submission "
"deadline, and language required (Chinese or English)."

msgid "提供個人資料給教授"
msgstr "Provide personal materials to the professor"

msgid "自傳、成績單、申請用途說明、對方機構背景，方便教授撰寫具體內容。"
msgstr ""
"Autobiography, transcript, explanation of application purpose, and "
"background of the receiving institution — to help the professor write "
"specific content."

msgid "確認格式：信封密封 / 線上填表"
msgstr "Confirm format: sealed envelope / online form"

msgid "部分申請要求教授直接寄至對方或填線上表單，提前確認避免格式錯誤。"
msgstr ""
"Some applications require the professor to send directly to the recipient or"
" fill out an online form. Confirm in advance to avoid format errors."

msgid "繳交前再次確認截止日"
msgstr "Reconfirm the deadline before submission"

msgid "截止日前 1 週提醒教授，以防對方忘記。"
msgstr "Remind the professor 1 week before the deadline in case they forget."

msgid "選擇熟悉你的教授（上過課、做過研究），推薦信內容會更有說服力。"
msgstr ""
"Choose a professor who knows you well (from class or research) — the "
"recommendation letter will be more convincing."

msgid "目前尚未收錄你的學校資訊。"
msgstr "Your school's information has not been added yet."

msgid "請參考學校官網或洽詢教務處。"
msgstr ""
"Please refer to your school's official website or contact the Academic "
"Affairs Office."

msgid "抵台第一件事"
msgstr "First thing after arriving in Taiwan"

msgid "台灣門號是生活的基礎：LINE 認證、銀行 OTP、地圖導航都需要本地號碼。本頁整理預付卡與月租方案的辦理說明。"
msgstr ""
"A Taiwan phone number is essential for daily life: LINE verification, bank "
"OTP, and map navigation all require a local number. This page covers prepaid"
" cards and monthly plan options."

msgid "剛抵台、還沒拿到 ARC？"
msgstr "Just arrived in Taiwan and don't have your ARC yet?"

msgid "可先在機場或便利商店購買「預付卡」（只需護照），等取得 ARC 後再辦月租方案。"
msgstr ""
"You can first buy a prepaid SIM card at the airport or convenience store "
"(passport only), then switch to a monthly plan once you have your ARC."

msgid "預付卡（易付卡）"
msgstr "Prepaid SIM Card"

msgid "無 ARC 可辦"
msgstr "No ARC required"

msgid "只需護照即可辦理。7-Eleven、全家便利商店、機場均有售。適合剛抵台、ARC 尚未核發的過渡期使用。"
msgstr ""
"Only a passport is required. Available at 7-Eleven, FamilyMart, and the "
"airport. Ideal for the transition period after arriving before your ARC is "
"issued."

msgid "需要：護照"
msgstr "Required: Passport"

msgid "費用：約 NT$300 起（含一個月通話 + 數據）"
msgstr "Cost: From approx. NT$300 (includes 1 month of calls + data)"

msgid "月租方案（後付型）"
msgstr "Monthly Plan (postpaid)"

msgid "ARC 後辦理"
msgstr "Apply after getting ARC"

msgid "費率較優惠，數據量大，適合長期留學使用。需持 ARC 及台灣銀行帳戶或信用卡辦理。多數學生取得 ARC 後即改辦月租。"
msgstr ""
"Better rates, large data allowance, ideal for long-term study. Requires ARC "
"and a Taiwan bank account or credit card. Most students switch to this after"
" getting their ARC."

msgid "需要：ARC + 護照 + 銀行帳戶（或信用卡）"
msgstr "Required: ARC + Passport + Bank account (or credit card)"

msgid "費用：約 NT$399～699/月（依方案）"
msgstr "Cost: Approx. NT$399–699/month (depending on plan)"

msgid "中華電信"
msgstr "Chunghwa Telecom"

msgid "涵蓋範圍最廣，山區及偏遠地帶訊號最佳"
msgstr "Widest coverage; best signal in mountain and remote areas"

msgid "台灣大哥大"
msgstr "Taiwan Mobile"

msgid "都會區訊號佳，學生方案較多"
msgstr "Good signal in urban areas; more student plans available"

msgid "遠傳電信"
msgstr "FarEasTone"

msgid "北部訊號穩定，資費具競爭力"
msgstr "Stable signal in northern Taiwan; competitive pricing"

msgid "亞太電信"
msgstr "APT (Asia Pacific Telecom)"

msgid "資費較低，適合純數據需求"
msgstr "Lower rates; suitable for data-only users"

msgid "居留證（ARC）正本"
msgstr "ARC (Alien Resident Certificate) original"

msgid "必備"
msgstr "Required"

msgid "護照正本"
msgstr "Passport original"

msgid "台灣銀行帳戶 或 信用卡（扣繳費用）"
msgstr "Taiwan bank account or credit card (for bill payment)"

msgid "必備其一"
msgstr "One required"

msgid "學生證（部分業者提供學生優惠）"
msgstr "Student ID (some carriers offer student discounts)"

msgid "建議攜帶"
msgstr "Recommended"

msgid "選擇電信業者與方案"
msgstr "Choose a carrier and plan"

msgid "前往各大電信官網比較方案（通話 + 數據）。若預算有限且主要使用數據，可選純數據吃到飽方案（約 NT$399/月）。"
msgstr ""
"Visit the major carriers' websites to compare plans (calls + data). If on a "
"budget and mainly using data, consider an unlimited data-only plan (approx. "
"NT$399/month)."

msgid "前往電信門市"
msgstr "Visit a carrier store"

msgid ""
"攜帶 ARC、護照、銀行帳戶或信用卡，前往電信門市（中壢市區各電信均有門市）。告知工作人員「辦新門號，持有居留證」，通常 30 分鐘內可完成。"
msgstr ""
"Bring your ARC, passport, bank account or credit card to a carrier store "
"(all major carriers have stores in Zhongli). Tell the staff you want to "
"'register a new number with a resident certificate'. Usually takes under 30 "
"minutes."

msgid "選擇門號與 SIM 卡規格"
msgstr "Choose your number and SIM size"

msgid ""
"可自選門號（特殊號碼需加費），並選擇 SIM 卡尺寸（目前多數手機使用 nano SIM）。確認手機是否為「全頻段解鎖版」以確保在台灣 5G/4G "
"正常使用。"
msgstr ""
"You can choose your number (special numbers cost extra) and SIM size (most "
"phones now use nano SIM). Confirm your phone is 'fully unlocked' to ensure "
"5G/4G works in Taiwan."

msgid "插卡啟用，設定網路"
msgstr "Insert SIM and configure network"

msgid "插入 SIM 卡後，系統通常自動完成 APN 設定。若無法上網，可請門市人員協助手動設定 APN。"
msgstr ""
"After inserting the SIM, APN settings are usually configured automatically. "
"If you can't connect, ask store staff to help set the APN manually."

msgid "中央大學附近："
msgstr "Near NCU:"

msgid "中壢市區（火車站附近）的各電信門市均有服務，中華電信、台灣大哥大、遠傳在中壢光明街及中正路均設有門市。"
msgstr ""
"All major carriers have stores in Zhongli city center (near the train "
"station). Chunghwa Telecom, Taiwan Mobile, and FarEasTone all have stores on"
" Guangming Street and Zhongzheng Road."

msgid "保留原國際漫遊號碼："
msgstr "Keep your home country number (roaming):"

msgid "許多同學選擇保留母國門號（國際漫遊）用於家人聯絡，再辦一支台灣本地號供日常使用，雙卡手機更方便。"
msgstr ""
"Many students keep their home country number (international roaming) for "
"family contact, and get a local Taiwan number for daily use. A dual-SIM "
"phone makes this much more convenient."

msgid "月租方案需綁定扣款帳戶："
msgstr "Monthly plans require a linked payment account:"

msgid "銀行帳戶餘額不足時，電信業者可能暫停門號。請確保每月帳戶有足夠餘額。"
msgstr ""
"If your bank account balance is insufficient, the carrier may suspend your "
"number. Make sure you have enough balance in your account each month."

msgid "領獎學金・生活必備"
msgstr "Collect scholarships · Daily essentials"

msgid "在台留學期間，銀行帳戶是領取獎學金、支付租金與日常消費的基本工具。本頁整理開戶銀行選擇與流程說明。"
msgstr ""
"During your studies in Taiwan, a bank account is essential for receiving "
"scholarships, paying rent, and daily spending. This page covers bank options"
" and the account-opening process."

msgid "中華郵政（郵局）"
msgstr "Chunghwa Post (Post Office)"

msgid "外籍生首選"
msgstr "Top pick for international students"

msgid "全台門市最廣，外籍生開戶最友善，"
msgstr ""
"Widest branch network in Taiwan, most foreigner-friendly for account opening"
" — "

msgid "當日即可拿到存摺與提款卡"
msgstr "passbook and ATM card on the same day"

msgid "，不像一般銀行需等 3–5 個工作天審核。"
msgstr ", unlike regular banks where you wait 3–5 business days for approval."

msgid "優點："
msgstr "Pros:"

msgid "當日領卡、未有 ARC 也可辦（持統一證號）、存款有政府保障"
msgstr ""
"Same-day card issuance; can open without ARC (using Unified ID); deposits "
"protected by government"

msgid "缺點："
msgstr "Cons:"

msgid "ATM 主要在郵局內，跨行提款每次 NT$5+，轉帳超額 NT$8–15；App 功能較基本"
msgstr ""
"ATMs mainly inside post offices; inter-bank withdrawal NT$5+ each; transfer "
"fee NT$8–15; app features are basic"

msgid "多人同行請提前預約，避免等候過久"
msgstr "Groups should book in advance to avoid long waits"

msgid "多數郵局營業至 17:00，部分郵局更晚（比銀行多 1.5 小時）"
msgstr ""
"Most post offices open until 17:00, some even later (1.5 hours more than "
"regular banks)"

msgid "台灣銀行"
msgstr "Bank of Taiwan"

msgid "獎學金首選"
msgstr "Top pick for scholarship recipients"

msgid "政府機關及教育部獎學金通常匯入台灣銀行帳戶，若你有申請政府獎學金則必備。中壢市區有分行。"
msgstr ""
"Government agency and Ministry of Education scholarships are usually "
"deposited into Bank of Taiwan accounts — essential if you receive a "
"government scholarship. There is a branch in Zhongli."

msgid "玉山銀行"
msgstr "E.Sun Bank"

msgid "線上銀行介面完善，英文客服較佳，支援 Apple Pay / Google Pay。對外籍生相對友善。"
msgstr ""
"Excellent online banking interface, better English customer service, "
"supports Apple Pay / Google Pay. Relatively foreigner-friendly."

msgid "國泰世華銀行"
msgstr "Cathay United Bank"

msgid "ATM 據點多，與多家電商合作，網路銀行功能完整，學生使用廣泛。"
msgstr ""
"Many ATM locations, partnerships with major e-commerce platforms, "
"comprehensive online banking features, widely used by students."

msgid "雙證件之一"
msgstr "One of two required IDs"

msgid "或 統一證號基資表（尚未領 ARC 者）"
msgstr "or Unified ID Registration Form (if ARC not yet issued)"

msgid "木頭刻印章（英文姓名）"
msgstr "Wooden name stamp (English name)"

msgid "— 原子章、橡皮章不可用"
msgstr "— ball-point and rubber stamps not accepted"

msgid "現金 NT$100（不收刷卡）"
msgstr "Cash NT$100 (cards not accepted)"

msgid "視需求"
msgstr "As needed"

msgid "台灣本人手機號碼（辦 Visa 卡時需要）"
msgstr "Your Taiwan mobile number (required when applying for Visa card)"

msgid "木頭印章哪裡買？"
msgstr "Where to buy a wooden name stamp?"

msgid ""
"學校附近文具店均可刻製，告知老闆「要刻木頭章」並提供英文全名，費用約 NT$50–100，等候約 20 "
"分鐘。建議事前刻好，開戶當天直接帶去。印章等同你的簽名，請與存摺分開保管。"
msgstr ""
"Any stationery store near campus can make one. Tell the owner you need a "
"wooden name stamp and provide your full English name. Cost: approx. "
"NT$50–100, wait about 20 minutes. Have it made in advance and bring it on "
"account-opening day. Your stamp equals your signature — keep it separate "
"from your passbook."

msgid "已領有居留證（ARC）者："
msgstr "If you already have an ARC:"

msgid "居留證號即為統一證號，無須另行申請，直接帶 ARC 正本開戶即可。"
msgstr ""
"Your ARC number is your Unified ID — no separate application needed. Just "
"bring your original ARC to open an account."

msgid "尚未取得居留證者（部分港澳生）："
msgstr "If you don't have an ARC yet (some HK/Macau students):"

msgid ""
"需另向停留地移民署服務站申請「統一證號基資表」，攜帶護照正本及影本（免貼照片）。此號碼終身固定，日後領到居留證後，ARC 號碼會與統一證號一致。"
msgstr ""
"You must apply for a 'Unified ID Registration Form' at the local Immigration"
" Service Station, bringing your original passport and a photocopy (no photo "
"required). This number is permanent for life; once you receive your ARC, the"
" ARC number will match your Unified ID."

msgid "建議選擇有 VISA 功能的 Debit Card（扣帳卡）："
msgstr "We recommend choosing a Debit Card with VISA functionality:"

msgid ""
"可 ATM 提款，也能直接刷卡消費、網購。郵局提供 VISA + 悠遊卡 或 VISA + 一卡通 兩種組合，可按需求選擇。請注意部分台灣商家不接受 "
"VISA Debit，付款前請確認。"
msgstr ""
"Use it at ATMs and also pay directly in-store or online. The post office "
"offers two combinations: VISA + EasyCard or VISA + iPASS — choose based on "
"your needs. Note that some Taiwanese merchants do not accept VISA Debit; "
"confirm before paying."

msgid "建議先辦好 SIM 卡再去開戶："
msgstr "Get your SIM card before opening a bank account:"

msgid "開通網路銀行與 Visa 卡需台灣手機號接收驗證碼，先有門號才能當場一次搞定。"
msgstr ""
"Activating online banking and a Visa card requires a Taiwan mobile number to"
" receive OTPs. Having a local number means you can complete everything in "
"one visit."

msgid "注意營業時間 + 預留足夠時間："
msgstr "Check business hours and allow enough time:"

msgid "一般銀行週一至週五 09:00–15:30，郵局多至 17:00。外籍生開戶流程通常需 1 小時以上，請勿太晚抵達，以免被請回。"
msgstr ""
"Regular banks are open Mon–Fri 09:00–15:30; most post offices until 17:00. "
"Account opening for foreign students usually takes over 1 hour — don't "
"arrive too late or you may be turned away."

msgid "台灣日期格式：先寫月份、再寫日子"
msgstr "Taiwan date format: month first, then day"

msgid " — 2 月 1 日 = 2025/2/1（與部分地區習慣相反），簽文件時請注意。"
msgstr ""
" — February 1 = 2025/2/1 (opposite to some regions' conventions). Be careful"
" when signing documents."

msgid "建議前往學校附近郵局："
msgstr "We recommend the post office near campus:"

msgid "大學周邊郵局對僑外生開戶經驗豐富，審核較快，手續更熟練。"
msgstr ""
"Post offices near universities have extensive experience helping "
"international students open accounts — reviews are faster and procedures are"
" smoother."

msgid "ARC 到期後記得更新帳戶資料："
msgstr "Remember to update your account details when your ARC expires:"

msgid "ARC 換新後需至銀行更新證件資料，避免帳戶被凍結。"
msgstr ""
"After renewing your ARC, visit the bank to update your ID documents to "
"prevent your account from being frozen."

msgid "重要警示"
msgstr "Important Warnings"

msgid "絕對不要將帳戶借給他人："
msgstr "Never lend your account to others:"

msgid "依台灣法規，出借存摺、提款卡、網銀密碼均屬違法，輕則被列為詐騙嫌疑人，重則承擔刑事責任。若發現帳戶遭盜用或存摺遺失，請立即通知銀行。"
msgstr ""
"Under Taiwan law, lending your passbook, ATM card, or online banking "
"password is illegal. At minimum you may be listed as a fraud suspect; at "
"worst you face criminal liability. If your account is compromised or "
"passbook lost, notify the bank immediately."

msgid "不要短期內在多家銀行開戶："
msgstr "Do not open accounts at multiple banks in a short period:"

msgid "台灣每次開戶銀行均會「拉聯徵」（查信用報告）。短期內記錄過多，銀行可能主動來電詢問，甚至拒絕開戶（防人頭戶）。建議先開 1–2 家即可。"
msgstr ""
"Every time you open an account in Taiwan, the bank runs a credit inquiry. "
"Too many inquiries in a short time may prompt the bank to call you or even "
"reject your application (to prevent ghost accounts). Start with 1–2 banks."

msgid "外籍生・僑生必辦"
msgstr "Required for international & overseas students"

msgid "僑生、外籍生（僑外生）取得居留證明文件來臺就學，自合於投保資格之日起，依法應參加全民健康保險。"
msgstr ""
"Overseas Chinese students and international students (overseas/foreign "
"students) who obtain residency documents to study in Taiwan are legally "
"required to enroll in National Health Insurance from the date they become "
"eligible."

msgid "新生第一學期保險（未達健保資格前）"
msgstr "First-semester insurance for new students (before NHI eligibility)"

msgid "重要："
msgstr "Important:"

msgid "剛抵台的僑生新生，尚未滿足「在台居留 6 個月」的健保加保資格，需先加入以下保險："
msgstr ""
"Newly arrived overseas Chinese students have not yet met the '6 months of "
"residence in Taiwan' requirement for NHI enrollment, and must first join one"
" of the following insurance plans:"

msgid "僑保（海外華人保險）"
msgstr "OCAC Insurance (Overseas Chinese Insurance)"

msgid "適用對象：首次入台的大一僑生新生（只能加保一次）"
msgstr ""
"Eligible: First-year overseas Chinese students arriving in Taiwan for the "
"first time (can only enroll once)"

msgid "保費：自費 NT$600（僑委會補助 NT$600，合計 NT$1,200）"
msgstr "Premium: NT$600 self-pay (OCAC subsidizes NT$600, total NT$1,200)"

msgid "保障期間：6 個月（一學期）"
msgstr "Coverage period: 6 months (one semester)"

msgid "由國際事務處協助辦理"
msgstr "Handled with assistance from the Office of International Affairs"

msgid "國泰人壽保險"
msgstr "Cathay Life Insurance"

msgid "適用對象：第二學期起或不符合僑保資格者"
msgstr ""
"Eligible: From the second semester onwards, or those not qualifying for OCAC"
" Insurance"

msgid "保費：NT$3,000 / 學期（最長六個月）"
msgstr "Premium: NT$3,000 / semester (up to six months)"

msgid "由國際事務處協助加保"
msgstr "Enrollment assisted by the Office of International Affairs"

msgid "理賠申請：至國際處填寫申請書，並攜帶醫療收據、診斷證明、居留證影本、護照影本、郵局存簿影本及個資同意書"
msgstr ""
"Claims: Complete a claim form at the OIA, and bring medical receipts, "
"diagnosis certificate, ARC copy, passport copy, post office passbook copy, "
"and personal data consent form"

msgid "全民健保投保規定"
msgstr "NHI Enrollment Rules"

msgid "項目"
msgstr "Item"

msgid "僑外生就學期間"
msgstr "During studies (overseas/foreign students)"

msgid "僑外生經許可工作期間"
msgstr "During permitted employment (overseas/foreign students)"

msgid "投保資格"
msgstr "Eligibility"

msgid "自在臺居留滿 6 個月之日投保"
msgstr "Enroll from the date of completing 6 months of residence in Taiwan"

msgid "自受僱當日投保（無等待期）"
msgstr "Enroll from the date of employment (no waiting period)"

msgid "投保身分"
msgstr "Insured category"

msgid "第 6 類第 2 目被保險人"
msgstr "Category 6, subcategory 2 insured"

msgid "第 1 類被保險人（受僱者）"
msgstr "Category 1 insured (employee)"

msgid "投保方式"
msgstr "Enrollment method"

msgid "以就讀學校為投保單位辦理"
msgstr "Enrolled through the attending school as the insuring unit"

msgid "以工作單位為投保單位辦理"
msgstr "Enrolled through the employer as the insuring unit"

msgid "※ 短期性工作未逾 3 個月者，可選擇以原投保資格繼續投保"
msgstr ""
"※ Those working short-term (under 3 months) may choose to continue "
"enrollment under their original insured category"

msgid "「在臺居留滿 6 個月」認定方式"
msgstr "How to count '6 months of residence in Taiwan'"

msgid ""
"指進入臺灣地區連續居住達 6 個月，或曾出境 1 次且未逾 30 日，實際居住期間扣除出境日數後，併計達 6 個月。若出境超過 1 次，或出境一次超過 "
"30 天，則從重新抵台當天起算，6 個月重新計算。"
msgstr ""
"This means continuously residing in Taiwan for 6 months, or having departed "
"once for no more than 30 days, with the actual residence period minus "
"departure days totaling 6 months. If you depart more than once, or depart "
"once for over 30 days, the 6-month count restarts from the day you return to"
" Taiwan."

msgid "計算範例："
msgstr "Calculation example:"

msgid "入境日：113/9/1 → 未曾出境 → 投保日：114/3/1"
msgstr "Entry date: 113/9/1 → No departures → Enrollment date: 114/3/1"

msgid "入境日：113/9/1 → 曾出境 1 次（114/1/1–1/5，共 4 天）→ 投保日：114/3/5"
msgstr ""
"Entry date: 113/9/1 → Departed once (114/1/1–1/5, 4 days total) → Enrollment"
" date: 114/3/5"

msgid "在臺參加健保注意事項"
msgstr "Notes on NHI enrollment in Taiwan"

msgid "僑外生在臺就學並符合投保資格期間，應以就讀學校為投保單位辦理投保。"
msgstr ""
"Overseas/foreign students studying in Taiwan who meet the eligibility "
"requirements must enroll in NHI through their school as the insuring unit."

msgid "僑外生經許可在臺工作並受僱，投保單位（雇主）應於被保險人合於投保資格之日起 3 日內，向健保署辦理投保。"
msgstr ""
"When overseas/foreign students are permitted to work in Taiwan and are "
"employed, the insuring unit (employer) must complete NHI enrollment within 3"
" days of the insured becoming eligible."

msgid "於受僱單位投保時，應先至學校辦理轉出，避免重複投保。"
msgstr ""
"When enrolling through an employer, first arrange a transfer-out from the "
"school to avoid duplicate enrollment."

msgid "與工作單位終止僱傭關係後，應另以適法身分投保：若已受新單位聘僱，於新單位投保；未受聘僱期間則應回學校辦理投保。"
msgstr ""
"After ending employment, enroll under another eligible status: if hired by a"
" new employer, enroll through the new employer; during periods without "
"employment, return to school enrollment."

msgid "符合投保資格且無工作期間，若配偶、父母或子女在臺已為健保被保險人，應以眷屬身分依附其投保單位加保。"
msgstr ""
"During eligible but unemployed periods, if a spouse, parent, or child in "
"Taiwan is already an NHI insured, you should enroll as a dependent under "
"their insuring unit."

msgid "在學證明（學生證或在學證明書）"
msgstr "Proof of enrollment (student ID or certificate of enrollment)"

msgid "台灣銀行帳戶（保費扣繳用）"
msgstr "Taiwan bank account (for premium deduction)"

msgid "建議"
msgstr "Recommended"

msgid "1 吋照片（部分單位需要）"
msgstr "1-inch photo (required by some offices)"

msgid "清寒僑生健保費補助："
msgstr "NHI premium subsidy for low-income overseas Chinese students:"

msgid ""
"符合清寒資格加入健保者，可向國際事務處申請每月 NT$413 補助（需檢附清寒證明，審查通過後核發）。未得補助者每月保費約 "
"NT$826。詳情請洽國際事務處。"
msgstr ""
"Those who qualify as low-income and enroll in NHI may apply to the OIA for a"
" monthly subsidy of NT$413 (requires proof of low-income status; granted "
"after review). Without the subsidy, the monthly premium is approx. NT$826. "
"Contact the OIA for details."

msgid "相關文件下載"
msgstr "Download related documents"

msgid "在臺僑生、外籍生參加全民健康保險須知（PDF）↓"
msgstr "NHI Enrollment Guide for Overseas/Foreign Students in Taiwan (PDF) ↓"

msgid "小病先看診所："
msgstr "See a clinic for minor illnesses first:"

msgid ""
"台灣採分級醫療，一般疾病先至診所（家醫科、內科）就診，費用僅 NT$150 左右。直接前往醫院急診或門診需負擔較高部分負擔（NT$240～480）。"
msgstr ""
"Taiwan uses a tiered healthcare system. For common illnesses, visit a clinic"
" first (family medicine or internal medicine) — the co-pay is only about "
"NT$150. Going directly to a hospital emergency room or outpatient department"
" requires a higher co-pay (NT$240–480)."

msgid "下載「健保快易通」App："
msgstr "Download the 'NHI Express' App:"

msgid "可查詢健保狀態、就醫紀錄，並顯示數位健保卡，出門不怕忘帶實體卡。"
msgstr ""
"Check your NHI status, medical records, and display a digital health "
"insurance card — no need to worry about forgetting your physical card."

msgid "暑假返鄉超過 2 個月時："
msgstr "If returning home for more than 2 months during summer break:"

msgid "建議辦理「出國停保」避免繼續扣繳保費；回台後記得立即「復保」恢復保障。"
msgstr ""
"Apply for 'departure suspension' to avoid continued premium deductions; "
"remember to 'reinstate coverage' immediately upon returning to Taiwan."

msgid "全民健康保險署官網 ↗"
msgstr "NHI Administration Official Website ↗"

msgid "非本國籍人士加保說明 ↗"
msgstr "NHI Enrollment Guide for Non-ROC Nationals ↗"

msgid "衛保組・診所・醫院・急診"
msgstr "Health Center · Clinic · Hospital · Emergency"

msgid "台灣採分級醫療制度，小病先看診所、大病再轉醫院。持健保卡就醫費用大幅降低，急救請撥 119。"
msgstr ""
"Taiwan uses a tiered healthcare system — minor illnesses go to a clinic "
"first, serious ones to a hospital. NHI card holders pay much less. Call 119 "
"for emergencies."

msgid "台灣分級醫療制度"
msgstr "Taiwan's Tiered Healthcare System"

msgid "衛保組 / 診所"
msgstr "Health Center / Clinic"

msgid "健保約 NT$150–200"
msgstr "NHI co-pay approx. NT$150–200"

msgid "一般感冒、輕傷、慢性病、定期回診"
msgstr "Common cold, minor injuries, chronic conditions, routine follow-ups"

msgid "地區醫院（門診）"
msgstr "District Hospital (Outpatient)"

msgid "健保約 NT$240–360"
msgstr "NHI co-pay approx. NT$240–360"

msgid "需要進一步檢查、診所無法處理者"
msgstr "Requires further testing or beyond clinic capacity"

msgid "醫學中心（急診）"
msgstr "Medical Center (Emergency)"

msgid "健保約 NT$450–600"
msgstr "NHI co-pay approx. NT$450–600"

msgid "嚴重外傷、危及生命、需要手術"
msgstr "Serious trauma, life-threatening conditions, surgery needed"

msgid "台灣分級醫療制度下，直接去大醫院門診的部分負擔比診所高 2–3 倍。輕症先到診所就診，若需轉診，醫師會開立轉診單，可享受較低的部分負擔。"
msgstr ""
"Under Taiwan's tiered system, going directly to a large hospital outpatient "
"department costs 2–3× more than a clinic. See a clinic first for minor "
"illness; if a referral is needed the doctor will issue one, qualifying you "
"for a lower co-pay."

msgid "校內衛保組（NCU）"
msgstr "On-campus Health Center (NCU)"

msgid "地點"
msgstr "Location"

msgid "中正圖書館（舊圖）1 樓"
msgstr "Zhongzheng Library (Old Library), 1F"

msgid "電話"
msgstr "Phone"

msgid "分機 57271"
msgstr "Ext. 57271"

msgid "服務時間"
msgstr "Service Hours"

msgid "週一至週五"
msgstr "Monday to Friday"

msgid "08:00–17:00（寒暑假可能調整）"
msgstr "08:00–17:00 (hours may vary during winter/summer break)"

msgid "服務項目"
msgstr "Services"

msgid "基本診療・諮詢・轉介"
msgstr "Basic consultation · Advice · Referrals"

msgid "量血壓、用藥諮詢、轉診協助、新生體檢"
msgstr ""
"Blood pressure check, medication advice, referral assistance, new student "
"health check"

msgid "衛保組適合輕症初診，如感冒、發燒、輕傷等。若需進一步診療，衛保組可協助轉介至校外診所或醫院。"
msgstr ""
"The campus health center is suitable for first visits with minor symptoms "
"such as colds, fever, or light injuries. If further treatment is needed, "
"staff can help refer you to an off-campus clinic or hospital."

msgid "非上班時間請直接前往校外診所或急診。"
msgstr ""
"Outside office hours, go directly to an off-campus clinic or emergency room."

msgid "校外診所（後門商圈 / 中壢周邊）"
msgstr "Off-campus Clinics (Back Gate Area / Zhongli District)"

msgid ""
"中央大學後門商圈及中壢市區有多間診所，持健保卡就診費用約 NT$150–200。可依科別用 Google Maps 搜尋「中壢 內科診所」、「中壢 "
"耳鼻喉科」等。"
msgstr ""
"There are many clinics in the NCU back-gate area and Zhongli city. With an "
"NHI card, visits cost about NT$150–200. Search Google Maps by specialty, "
"e.g. 'Zhongli internal medicine clinic' or 'Zhongli ENT clinic'."

msgid "診所看診時間："
msgstr "Clinic hours:"

msgid ""
"多數診所採早診（08:30–12:00）、午診（14:00–17:30）、晚診（18:00–21:00）三班制，非所有診所皆有晚診。建議事先電話確認或查詢"
" Google 地圖上的即時等候人數。"
msgstr ""
"Most clinics operate in three sessions: morning (08:30–12:00), afternoon "
"(14:00–17:30), and evening (18:00–21:00). Not all clinics offer evening "
"sessions. It is recommended to call ahead or check real-time wait numbers on"
" Google Maps."

msgid "周邊醫院"
msgstr "Nearby Hospitals"

msgid "最近・急診24H"
msgstr "Nearest · 24H Emergency"

msgid "桃園市中壢區延平路150號"
msgstr "150 Yanping Rd., Zhongli Dist., Taoyuan City"

msgid "從中大搭公車約 15–20 分鐘；設有急診室（24 小時）"
msgstr "About 15–20 min by bus from NCU; has a 24-hour emergency room"

msgid "壢新醫院官網 ↗"
msgstr "Lixin Hospital Website ↗"

msgid "衛福部桃園醫院中壢院區"
msgstr "Ministry of Health and Welfare Taoyuan Hospital — Zhongli Branch"

msgid "桃園市中壢區中山東路二段16號"
msgstr "16 Sec. 2, Zhongshan E. Rd., Zhongli Dist., Taoyuan City"

msgid "公立醫院，設有門診及急診"
msgstr "Public hospital with outpatient and emergency departments"

msgid "林口長庚醫院"
msgstr "Linkou Chang Gung Memorial Hospital"

msgid "醫學中心"
msgstr "Medical Center"

msgid "桃園市龜山區舒民路5號"
msgstr "5 Shumin Rd., Guishan Dist., Taoyuan City"

msgid "中大搭車約 40 分鐘；台灣最大醫院之一，有多語言服務"
msgstr ""
"About 40 min from NCU; one of Taiwan's largest hospitals, multilingual "
"services available"

msgid "長庚醫院官網 ↗"
msgstr "Chang Gung Hospital Website ↗"

msgid "急診 / 緊急情況"
msgstr "Emergency / Urgent Situations"

msgid "危及生命・嚴重受傷・無法自行就醫"
msgstr "Life-threatening · Serious injury · Unable to seek medical help alone"

msgid "請立即撥打緊急電話，或由旁人送至最近有急診的醫院（壢新醫院）。急診 24 小時全年無休。"
msgstr ""
"Call emergency services immediately, or have someone take you to the nearest"
" hospital with an emergency room (Lixin Hospital). Emergency room open 24 "
"hours, 365 days."

msgid "救護車・火災"
msgstr "Ambulance · Fire"

msgid "免費撥打，全球手機可用"
msgstr "Free to call, works on any mobile worldwide"

msgid "警察局"
msgstr "Police"

msgid "報案・協助"
msgstr "Report crime · Assistance"

msgid "國際緊急號碼"
