msgid "任何手機（含無 SIM 卡）皆可撥打"
msgstr "Works on any phone, including phones without a SIM card"

msgid "外來人士生活諮詢"
msgstr "Foreign Residents Hotline"

msgid "多語言，含醫療協助"
msgstr "Multilingual, includes medical assistance"

msgid "急診部分負擔較高："
msgstr "Emergency co-pay is higher:"

msgid "非緊急狀況直接掛急診，健保部分負擔為 NT$450–600（比診所高 3 倍以上）。輕症建議前往診所就診，急診留給真正緊急的情況。"
msgstr ""
"Going directly to the emergency room for non-emergencies costs NT$450–600 in"
" NHI co-pay — more than 3× the clinic rate. Minor illness should go to a "
"clinic; save the ER for genuine emergencies."

msgid "健保就醫費用對照"
msgstr "NHI Medical Fee Comparison"

