msgid "衛保組（校內）"
msgstr "Campus Health Center"

msgid "免費 / 極低費"
msgstr "Free / Very low cost"

msgid "視項目收費"
msgstr "Charged by service"

msgid "診所"
msgstr "Clinic"

msgid "約 NT$150–200"
msgstr "Approx. NT$150–200"

msgid "全額自費（NT$500–1,000+）"
msgstr "Full out-of-pocket (NT$500–1,000+)"

msgid "地區醫院門診"
msgstr "District Hospital Outpatient"

msgid "約 NT$240–360"
msgstr "Approx. NT$240–360"

msgid "全額自費（NT$1,000+）"
msgstr "Full out-of-pocket (NT$1,000+)"

msgid "醫學中心門診"
msgstr "Medical Center Outpatient"

msgid "約 NT$360–480"
msgstr "Approx. NT$360–480"

msgid "全額自費（NT$2,000+）"
msgstr "Full out-of-pocket (NT$2,000+)"

msgid "急診"
msgstr "Emergency Room"

msgid "約 NT$450–600"
msgstr "Approx. NT$450–600"

msgid "全額自費（視治療而定）"
msgstr "Full out-of-pocket (depends on treatment)"

msgid "可顯示數位健保卡、查詢就醫紀錄與健保狀態，出門忘帶實體健保卡時可使用。"
msgstr ""
"Displays your digital NHI card, lets you check medical records and insurance"
" status — useful when you forget your physical card."

msgid "NCU 校安緊急聯絡"
msgstr "NCU Campus Safety Emergency Contacts"

msgid "分機 57212"
msgstr "Ext. 57212"

msgid "24 小時校安專線："
msgstr "24-hour campus safety hotline:"

msgid "國際事務處"
msgstr "Office of International Affairs"

msgid "分機 57081"
msgstr "Ext. 57081"

msgid "承辦人：徐心荷小姐"
msgstr "Contact person: Ms. Xu Xinhe"

#~ msgid "輸入你的問題，系統會根據你的身份與狀態整理建議。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enter your question, and the system will organize suggestions based on your "
#~ "identity and status."

msgid "1 年"
msgstr "1 year"

msgid "每年需延期"
msgstr "Must renew annually"

msgid "以下為一般應備文件，各移民署辦事處可能有細微差異。建議事前致電當地辦事處或至移民署官網確認最新版清單。"
msgstr ""
"The following are general required documents; individual NIA offices may "
"have slight variations. Call your local office or check the NIA website "
"for the latest list."

msgid "外國護照"
msgstr "Foreign Passport"

msgid "正本及影本各 1 份，效期須超過居留期間 6 個月以上。"
msgstr ""
"1 original and 1 copy; must be valid for at least 6 months beyond the "
"residence period."

msgid "入台學生簽證（居留簽）"
msgstr "Taiwan Student Visa (Resident Visa)"

msgid "持有入境台灣的學生居留簽證影本。"
msgstr "A copy of the student resident visa used to enter Taiwan."

msgid "僑生應核發的身份確認函"
msgstr "Identity Confirmation Letter for Overseas Chinese Students"

msgid "僑生還需提供僑委會或僑生應核發的身份確認文件正本及影本。"
msgstr ""
"Overseas Chinese students must also provide the original and copy of the "
"identity confirmation document issued by the OCAC or relevant authority."

msgid "在學證明書 / 清冊及通知書"
msgstr "Enrollment Certificate / Roster and Notification Letter"

msgid "由就讀學校出具的在學證明或入學許可函，需含入學日期及就讀系所。"
msgstr ""
"Enrollment certificate or admission letter from your school, including "
"enrollment date and department."

msgid "於台灣認可醫院完成之健康檢查報告，需含胸部 X 光及肺結核篩檢結果。"
msgstr ""
"Health examination report completed at a Taiwan-accredited hospital, "
"including chest X-ray and TB screening results."

msgid "近 6 個月內拍攝之 2 吋白底彩色照片（規格：寬 3.5 cm × 高 4.5 cm）。"
msgstr ""
"2-inch white-background color photo taken within the past 6 months (3.5 "
"cm × 4.5 cm)."

msgid "外僑居留申請書"
msgstr "Alien Resident Application Form"

msgid "可於移民署官網下載或現場索取，請事先填妥基本資料。"
msgstr ""
"Download from the NIA website or obtain on-site; fill in your basic "
"information in advance."

msgid "宿舍住宿證或租屋合約書，部分辦事處或要求。"
msgstr ""
"Dormitory residence certificate or rental contract; may be required by "
"some offices."

msgid "全程線上辦理："
msgstr "Fully online process:"

msgid "居留證申請及延期皆以線上申辦為主。請至移民署「外國與外僑學生線上申辦系統」自行申請，"
msgstr ""
"Both ARC applications and renewals are primarily handled online. Apply "
"yourself via the NIA's \"Online Application System for Foreign and "
"Overseas Students\";"

msgid "請勿選擇「就讀學校代辦」"
msgstr "do NOT select \"Apply through your school\""

msgid "（中央大學無此服務）。"
msgstr "(NCU does not offer this service)."

msgid "外國與外僑學生線上申辦系統 ↗"
msgstr "NIA Online Application System for Foreign/Overseas Students ↗"

msgid "抵台後完成體檢並整理文件"
msgstr "Complete health check and gather documents after arrival"

msgid ""
"確認護照、入學通知函、在學證明等文件齊全。若需完成健康檢查，請至學校認可醫院辦理（國際事務處可提供名單）。非港澳生及持有效居留證的港澳生可參加校內體檢（約 "
"NT$780）。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm your passport, admission letter, and enrollment certificate are "
"ready. If a health check is needed, visit a school-approved hospital "
"(OIA can provide a list). Non-HK/Macau students and HK/Macau students "
"with a valid ARC may use the on-campus health exam (approx. NT$780)."

msgid "至移民署線上系統註冊並上傳文件"
msgstr "Register and upload documents to the NIA online system"

msgid ""
"前往移民署「外國與外僑學生線上申辦系統」完成帳號註冊，掃描並上傳所需文件：近三個月 2 "
"吋彩色照片、護照、入學通知函及在學證明書。系統操作請參閱官方操作手冊。"
msgstr ""
"Go to the NIA \"Online Application System for Foreign/Overseas "
"Students\", register an account, scan and upload required documents: a "
"2-inch color photo from the past 3 months, passport, admission letter, "
"and enrollment certificate. Refer to the official user manual for system "
"guidance."

msgid "抵台後 30 天內"
msgstr "Within 30 days of arrival"

msgid "全程線上"
msgstr "Fully online"

msgid "繳納申請規費"
msgstr "Pay the application fee"

msgid "線上申請時繳交規費 NT$500（1 年居留證）。繳費後保存收據以備查。"
msgstr ""
"Pay NT$500 (1-year ARC) during the online application. Keep your receipt "
"for reference."

msgid "NT$500 / 年"
msgstr "NT$500 / year"

msgid "等待審核與製證"
msgstr "Wait for review and card production"

msgid "申請提交後通常需"
msgstr "After submission, production usually takes"

msgid "製卡完成（不含退補件）。可至移民署線上查詢申請進度。等待期間請保留入境章及申請收據作為合法居留的暫時證明。"
msgstr ""
"business days (excluding resubmissions). Check progress via the NIA "
"online system. Keep your entry stamp and application receipt as "
"temporary proof of legal residence during the wait."

msgid "可線上查詢進度"
msgstr "Progress trackable online"

msgid "上傳居留證至 NCU Portal"
msgstr "Upload ARC to NCU Portal"

msgid "取得居留證後，需於入學當年"
msgstr "After receiving your ARC, upload it to NCU Portal by"

msgid "月"
msgstr "month"

msgid "日前"
msgstr "of your enrollment year."

msgid "上傳至 NCU Portal（入口網站）。未準時上傳將影響校內工讀金撥款、獎學金核發及相關權益。"
msgstr ""
"Upload to NCU Portal. Failure to upload on time may affect on-campus "
"work-study pay, scholarship disbursements, and other entitlements."

msgid "9/30 前"
msgstr "Before September 30"

msgid "完成！辦理後續程序"
msgstr "Done! Complete follow-up procedures"

msgid "居留證到手後即可辦理加入健保、開設銀行帳戶、申辦手機門號等後續程序。"
msgstr ""
"Once you have your ARC, you can enroll in NHI, open a bank account, "
"apply for a mobile number, and complete other follow-up procedures."

msgid "居留證到期前"
msgstr "Before your ARC expires,"

msgid "個月內"
msgstr "month(s) in advance,"

msgid "可至移民署網站線上申請延期，規費 NT$500 / 年，核辦約 10 天。建議每學年結束前提早辦理，避免居留資格失效。"
msgstr ""
"you can apply for renewal online via the NIA website; fee NT$500/year, "
"processing about 10 days. Apply before the end of each academic year to "
"avoid lapse of residency status."

msgid "請勿選擇「就讀學校代辦」："
msgstr "Do NOT select \"Apply through your school\":"

msgid "中央大學（NCU）不提供學校代辦服務，請學生自行登入線上申辦系統辦理，勿在系統中選擇此選項。"
msgstr ""
"NCU does not offer school-assisted ARC applications. Students must log "
"in to the online system themselves and must not select this option."

msgid "居留證遺失時請立即至警局報案，持報案證明至移民署申請補發（規費 NT$500）。補發時建議隨身攜帶護照及報案證明。"
msgstr ""
"If your ARC is lost, immediately file a police report, then bring the "
"report to the NIA to apply for reissuance (fee NT$500). Carry your "
"passport and police report when applying."

msgid "我是台灣的僑生（台灣護照）的僑生也需要辦居留證嗎？"
msgstr ""
"I am an overseas Chinese student with a Taiwan passport — do I still "
"need an ARC?"

msgid "不需要。持中華民國籍由僑居地（台灣護照）入台的僑生，具有完整公民身份，無需辦理居留證。本頁服務適用於持外國護照入台就讀的僑生（海外永久居民等）。"
msgstr ""
"No. Overseas Chinese students who enter Taiwan with ROC citizenship "
"(Taiwan passport) have full citizen status and do not need an ARC. This "
"page is for overseas Chinese students who enter Taiwan with a foreign "
"passport (permanent residents abroad, etc.)."

msgid "健康檢查可以在抵台後才做嗎？"
msgstr "Can I do the health check after arriving in Taiwan?"

msgid ""
"可以。可於抵台後參加校內體檢（約 NT$780），或至學校指定醫院完成。注意檢查報告出爐需數天，請盡早安排以避免超過 30 "
"天辦理期限。建議抵台後隔天即至國際事務處詢問體檢安排。"
msgstr ""
"Yes. You can take the on-campus health exam (approx. NT$780) or go to a "
"school-designated hospital after arriving. Note that results take a few "
"days — arrange it early to stay within the 30-day deadline. Visit the "
"OIA the day after arrival to ask about exam arrangements."

msgid "居留證辦理期間可以在台灣合法居留嗎？"
msgstr ""
"Can I legally stay in Taiwan while my ARC application is being "
"processed?"

msgid "可以。申請提交後至居留證核發前，持入境章及申請收據即可作為合法居留證明。建議隨身攜帶此兩份文件，以備需要時出示。"
msgstr ""
"Yes. After submitting your application and before the ARC is issued, "
"your entry stamp and application receipt serve as proof of legal "
"residence. Carry both documents at all times in case you need to present "
"them."

msgid "可以在不同縣市的移民署辦事處辦理嗎？"
msgstr "Can I apply at an NIA office in a different city or county?"

msgid "可以。全台各縣市均設有移民署服務站，選擇距離學校最近的辦事處即可。但建議選擇學校所在縣市的辦事處，方便日後延期和處理相關事務。"
msgstr ""
"Yes. NIA service stations are available in all cities and counties. "
"Choose the office closest to your school. However, it is recommended to "
"use the office in the same county or city as your school for easier "
"renewal and related matters."

msgid "畢業後若要繼續留台，居留資格如何處理？"
msgstr ""
"What should I do about residency status if I want to stay in Taiwan "
"after graduation?"

msgid ""
"在學期間以「就讀」為居留事由。畢業後如需繼續留台（例如找工作），需在畢業後 30 "
"天內申請變更居留事由為「工作」或「其他」，或在找到合法工作並取得工作許可後辦理變更為「工作」居留事由。建議畢業前盡早規劃，避免居留證失效。"
msgstr ""
"During study, the residency purpose is \"study\". After graduation, if "
"you want to stay (e.g., to find work), apply to change the residency "
"purpose to \"work\" or \"other\" within 30 days of graduation, or after "
"finding legal employment and obtaining a work permit. Plan ahead before "
"graduation to avoid ARC expiration."

msgid "外國與外僑學生線上申辦系統"
msgstr "NIA Online Application System for Foreign/Overseas Students"

msgid "居留證線上申請入口，需自行註冊帳號並上傳文件。"
msgstr ""
"Online ARC application portal; register an account yourself and upload "
"documents."

msgid "辦事處查詢、線上預約、申請進度查詢、外僑居留申請書下載。"
msgstr ""
"Office finder, online appointment, application progress tracking, and "
"application form download."

msgid "僑務委員會（OCAC）"
msgstr "Overseas Community Affairs Council (OCAC)"

msgid "僑生身份確認函申請、僑生相關權益說明、海外服務諮詢。"
msgstr ""
"Apply for the overseas Chinese student identity confirmation letter, "
"learn about entitlements, and consult overseas services."

msgid "學校國際事務處"
msgstr "School Office of International Affairs (OIA)"

msgid "諮詢在學證明申請、指定合作醫院、移民署辦理協助等服務。"
msgstr ""
"Consult on enrollment certificate requests, designated hospital list, "
"and NIA application assistance."

msgid "提供多語言諮詢，包含居留、就業、生活等問題解答。"
msgstr ""
"Multilingual consultation covering residence, employment, and daily "
"life."

msgid "整理中央大學各宿舍區資訊、申請流程、房間設備和費用說明，幫助外籍生、僑生及交換學生預先申請校內住宿。"
msgstr ""
"A summary of NCU dormitory zones, application process, room facilities, "
"and fees to help international, overseas Chinese, and exchange students "
"apply for on-campus housing in advance."

